      "writtenOn": "2023-03-13T01:52:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "From https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MHg4v9llCS157nONPyopnVGnkmZhqbOxUVxRbgpEYXA/edit#bookmark\u003did.vcr55arlbio and https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MHg4v9llCS157nONPyopnVGnkmZhqbOxUVxRbgpEYXA/edit#bookmark\u003did.q7qqiwjf7k7y sections, a single template load takes ~500 ms (you said it\u0027s longer than you expected, but even if it\u0027s only half of time), so loading 3 templates at authentication time will introduce too much latency.\n\nI think we can\u0027t limit it to a single finger as well because we don\u0027t directly process the template decryption after preloading, so we can\u0027t do it one-by-one (they\u0027re all preloaded during login, and decrypted on each match).",
